<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
        <title>Nouveau message de contact</title>
    </head>
    <body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f3f4f6; color: #4b5563; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;">
        <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 40px 20px;">
            <tr>
                <td align="center">
                    <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="max-width: 768px; background-color: #fff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);">
                    
                        <!-- En-tête (Header) -->
                        <tr>
                            <td style="background-color: #0c326d; padding: 32px 40px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 4px solid #ef6e17;">
                                <h1 style="margin: 0; color: #fff; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.5px;">MyDigitrans</h1>
                                <p style="margin: 4px 0 0 0; color: #afd3e7; font-size: 14px;">Formulaire de contact du site internet</p>
                            </td>
                        </tr>

                        <!-- Contenu (Body) -->
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding: 40px;">
                                <h2 style="margin: 0 0 24px 0; color: #0c326d; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;">Un nouveau message a été déposé :</h2>
                            
                                <!-- Détails du message -->
                                <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="margin-bottom: 32px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px;">
                                    <tr>
                                        <td width="30%" style="padding: 6px 0; color: #4b5563; font-weight: 600; vertical-align: top;">Expéditeur</td>
                                        <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #000; font-weight: 500; vertical-align: top;">{{ full_name }}</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #4b5563; font-weight: 600; vertical-align: top;">Adresse e-mail</td>
                                        <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #000; vertical-align: top;"><a href="mailto:{{ sender_email }}" style="color: #1684c5; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500;">{{ sender_email }}</a></td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #4b5563; font-weight: 600; vertical-align: top;">Objet</td>
                                        <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #0c326d; font-weight: 600; vertical-align: top;">{{ subject_label }}</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #4b5563; font-weight: 600; vertical-align: top;">Reçu le</td>
                                        <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #4b5563; vertical-align: top;">{{ sent_at|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    {% if ip %}
                                        <tr>
                                            <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #4b5563; font-weight: 600; vertical-align: top;">Adresse IP</td>
                                            <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #4b5563; font-family: monospace; font-size: 13px; vertical-align: top;">{{ ip }}</td>
                                        </tr>
                                    {% endif %}
                                </table>

                                <!-- Bloc Message -->
                                <div style="margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0c326d; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Contenu du message :</div>
                                <div style="padding: 24px; background-color: #f3f4f6; border-left: 4px solid #ef6e17; border-radius: 4px; color: #000; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; white-space: pre-line;">
                                    {{ message }}
                                </div>
                            </td>
                        </tr>

                        <!-- Pied de page (Footer) -->
                        <tr>
                            <td style="background-color: #ef6e17; padding: 24px 40px; text-align: center;">
                                <p style="margin: 0; color: #fff; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 500;">
                                    Pour répondre, utilisez simplement le bouton <strong>« Répondre »</strong> de votre messagerie.<br>Le message partira vers <strong>{{ sender_email }}</strong>.
                                </p>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    </table>
                    <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="max-width: 600px; margin-top: 24px;">
                        <tr>
                            <td style="text-align: center; color: #4b5563; font-size: 12px;">
                                © {{ 'now'|date('Y') }} MyDigitrans. Tous droits réservés.
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    </table>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </body>
</html>
